<title>HONG KONG: CKI announces first final results.</title>
<headline>CKI announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   75.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    16.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    886.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,041.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 8-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheung Kong Infrastructure (CKI), a spinoff of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd, was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 17, 1996. Cheung Kong (Holdings) holds 73.02 percent of CKI.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
